    <mxCell id="reply" value="&lt;b&gt;Every reply&lt;/b&gt; is &lt;font face=&quot;monospace&quot;&gt;{exit, messages, partial, value}&lt;/font&gt;: the CLI&#x27;s --json output byte for byte, its stderr lines, and its exit code.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Who writes:&lt;/b&gt; the request&#x27;s &lt;font face=&quot;monospace&quot;&gt;actor&lt;/font&gt;, else the project&#x27;s git config, else &lt;font face=&quot;monospace&quot;&gt;no_actor&lt;/font&gt;. Someone else&#x27;s row is not refused: the CLI&#x27;s notice comes in messages." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#f3b38c;dashed=0;fontColor=#222222;fontSize=13;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
